Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: provide Qualcomm SMB5 property interface

Append the downstream charger properties and values used by the PM6150
SMB5, battery policy and SMB1396 drivers without renumbering existing
mainline properties. Expose the new properties through power_supply sysfs.

--- a/include/linux/power_supply.h
+++ b/include/linux/power_supply.h
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@
